T*
(being scores \(mean change +8.3 points versus +1.2 points control, P = 0.001\). Spiritual) Tj
T*
(well-being also improved in the intervention group \(mean change +6.7 points versus +0.9) Tj
T*
(points control, P = 0.003\). Participants reported high satisfaction \(92% rated) Tj
T*
